  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Brush tostada pieces with olive oil and toast for 5-7 minutes, or until crispy.",
    "3. In a bowl, mix together radish, Mexican spice blend, and salt.",
    "4. Spread a layer of radish mixture onto each toasted tostada piece.",
    "5. Top with shredded cheese and bake for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until cheese is melted and gooey.",
    "6. Garnish with chopped cilantro and a squeeze of lime juice.",
    "7. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
